      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been trying for a couple months now to help figure out any reproducible steps. I'm out of ideas. The particular freeze happens on both the SteamVR and Oculus versions of the game. It does appear to be isolated to Oculus CV1 users. \nStrange that you've only started to experience it now. I've had the freezes since the unity 2018 update released.\nMake sure you follow the instructions from the last canny post comments to provide information on this issue. https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrchat-randomly-crashes-to-desktop-with-no-error",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
