      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've definitely been experiencing this with CV1 as well since the 2018 update was released. I can hear and speak to others, but I only ever see that 1 frame that game got stuck to. Issue does seem to occur only when there's more populated instance than 2-3 people by far, but at random time. Other background stuff like Oculus Desktop and SteamVR still show running fine, just the game itself freezes.\nJust for noteworthy details, I run system with Ryzen 5 1600, GTX 1060 6gb and 16gbs of DDR4.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
