      "value": "@{5a7b6ce421453d21cc215bc4|full_name}: I dont know what is happening. I've been trying for the past 2 months to help reproduce the issue or help find a solution but now im just not getting any replies to my emails. I think the last canny was closed because there were multiple crashes being reported in the same post and they were fixing a bunch of different crashes from the unity 2018 release. As for this specific oculus crash last I was told is that they cant reproduce the issue on their end. It may very much be ignored until it can be consistently reproduced.",
